 "units": [
  {
   "unit_id": "unit-b26416eec95846a9b241b5bba9187deb",
   "title": "Initial Survey",
   "summary_sentences": [
    {
     "text": "User requests a survey of the main Jenkinsfile and all attached jobs, with the principle that Jenkins must remain operational during migration and both CI run in parallel until new CI is proven stable.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t000",
       "char_start": 58,
       "char_end": 151
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Assistant acknowledges the parallel-run approach and outlines steps: read the root Jenkinsfile, then use jenkins-cli to list all jobs and their configurations.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t001",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 174
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The main pipeline runs install, lint, 12 serial package build+typecheck stages (the biggest time sink), 4-shard parallel tests, and on main additionally Docker build plus staged deployment with a manual production approval gate; credentials use Jenkins credential IDs.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t003",
       "char_start": 143,
       "char_end": 166
      },
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t003",
       "char_start": 198,
       "char_end": 295
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "covered_turns": [
    "synth-c4-t000",
    "synth-c4-t001",
    "synth-c4-t002",
    "synth-c4-t003"
   ],
   "salient_infos": [],
   "frozen": true,
   "created_at_turn": "synth-c4-t035"
  },
  {
   "unit_id": "unit-6f3e298e025a4e1084fb374976421b4a",
   "title": "Job Inventory",
   "summary_sentences": [
    {
     "text": "User asks what other jobs exist on Jenkins, including scheduled tasks.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t004",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 42
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Assistant queries the Jenkins CLI for the full job list and each job's config.xml.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t005",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 73
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "There are five jobs: monorepo-pr (SCM poll every 2 minutes, wasteful), monorepo-main (webhook), nightly-e2e (nightly Playwright against staging), release-tag (tag-triggered image publish), and dependency-audit (weekly audit and mail).",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t007",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 184
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "covered_turns": [
    "synth-c4-t004",
    "synth-c4-t005",
    "synth-c4-t006",
    "synth-c4-t007"
   ],
   "salient_infos": [],
   "frozen": true,
   "created_at_turn": "synth-c4-t035"
  },
  {
   "unit_id": "unit-b3e72eed2e8c4539ac4699370194d00e",
   "title": "Plugin Mapping",
   "summary_sentences": [
    {
     "text": "User asks which Jenkins plugins are currently used and needs to find alternatives.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t008",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 32
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The jenkins-cli lists plugins including workflow-aggregator, git, docker-workflow, junit, slack, credentials-binding, timestamper, kubernetes-cli, throttle-concurrents, build-discarder, pipeline-stage-view, and email-ext.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t009",
       "char_start": 74,
       "char_end": 909
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Assistant maps plugins to Actions alternatives: junit→junit artifact, slack→slack action, credentials-binding→environment secrets, throttle-concurrents→concurrency group; no custom plugins found, migration surface clean.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t010",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 225
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "covered_turns": [
    "synth-c4-t008",
    "synth-c4-t009",
    "synth-c4-t010"
   ],
   "salient_infos": [],
