      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t022",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 140
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "The initial run fails on all 12 matrix jobs because pnpm is not installed on the runner image, with error \"pnpm: command not found\".",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t025",
       "char_start": 334,
       "char_end": 434
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Assistant diagnoses the pnpm issue and adds pnpm/action-setup@v4; also enables pnpm cache in setup-node and turbo cache.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t026",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 224
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "After the fix, the second run passes all 12 packages, wall clock 9m41s, roughly half of Jenkins serial build time.",
     "source_spans": [
      {
       "turn_id": "synth-c4-t029",
       "char_start": 0,
       "char_end": 92
      }
     ]
    }
